SUMMARY:FREE Breath Work Event at Wunderland
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Adventures 30’s & 40’s\nInterested in learning a
 bout breathwork? Me too! Let's attend this FREE event at Wunderland\, a ne
 w eco-adventure resort that offers a variety of wellness-focused amenities
 ! See below for details from Wunderland:\n\nJoin us for a 75-minute breath
 work experience with local breathwork guide\, Sasha Bannister. Active brea
 thwork is a full-body meditation for your heart\, body\, and mind. We'll u
 se breath to move energy\, release stuck tension\, and quiet the mental no
 ise. Expect to leave feeling lighter\, clearer\, and more embodied. It's l
 ike taking an internal shower.\n\nBreathwork session will be from 11a-12:1
 5p\, hosted by Sasha Bannister.\nAt 12:20p\, you can enjoy a brief 25-minu
 te talk about circadian health\, from Restorative Health Practitioner\, Le
 igh Etheridge.\nAt 12:45p\, you may choose to head home\, or stay for an o
 ptional community social\, complete with sauna\, cold plunge\, and soul tr
 ail!\n\nPlease bring water\, and a blanket or yoga mat (and pillow/bolster
  if you wish). If you choose to stay for the community social after breath
 work and circadian health talk\, please also bring a bathing suit and towe
 l as well!\n\nNote: While the event is free to attend\, there is a suggest
 ed $11 donation.\n\nIf you have any questions about the event itself\, ple
 ase contact events@wunderlandresort.com. If you have questions about the m
 eetup\, feel free to message me!\n\nHope to see you soon!
